Dialogue: 0,0:00:17.50,0:00:24.22,def2,DUMMY,0,0,0,,{\i1\c&HFFFFFF&}Saraba chikyuu yo, tabidatsu fune wa
Dialogue: 0,0:00:17.50,0:00:24.22,def2,DUMMY,0,0,0,,{\c&HFFFFFF&}Farewell Earth, a ship is taking off
Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.22,0:00:32.73,def2,DUMMY,0,0,0,,{\i1\c&HFFFFFF&}Uchuu Senkan Yamato
Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.22,0:00:32.73,def2,DUMMY,0,0,0,,{\c&HFFFFFF&}{uchuu senkan yamato}Space Battleship Yamato
Dialogue: 0,0:00:29.07,0:00:33.40,Karaoke Translation op,TITLE,0,0,0,,{\3c&HFFFFFF&\fscx150\fscy120\c&H000000&\pos(589,213)}Space Battleship
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.62,0:00:33.40,yamato,TITLE,0,0,0,,{\c&H0000FF&\fscx347\fscy257\pos(650,904)}Yamato
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.85,0:00:33.40,Karaoke Translation op,TITLE,0,0,0,,{\3c&HFFFFFF&\fscx167\fscy142\c&H000000&\\pos(1402,642)}A New Voyage
Dialogue: 0,0:00:33.20,0:00:40.77,def2,DUMMY,0,0,0,,{\i1\c&HFFFFFF&}Ucyuu no kanata Iskandar he unmei seoi ima tobitatsu
Dialogue: 0,0:00:33.20,0:00:40.77,def2,DUMMY,0,0,0,,{\c&HFFFFFF&}It's about to take off to Iscandar carrying the fate of humanity
Dialogue: 0,0:00:41.11,0:00:47.42,def2,DUMMY,0,0,0,,{\i1\c&HFFFFFF&}Kanarazu koko he kaette kuru to
Dialogue: 0,0:00:41.11,0:00:47.42,def2,DUMMY,0,0,0,,{\c&HFFFFFF&}We'll return for sure
Dialogue: 0,0:00:47.77,0:00:55.87,def2,DUMMY,0,0,0,,{\i1\c&HFFFFFF&}Te wo furu hito ni egao de kotae
Dialogue: 0,0:00:47.77,0:00:55.87,def2,DUMMY,0,0,0,,{\c&HFFFFFF&}Smile back at the people waving their hands
Dialogue: 0,0:00:56.30,0:01:02.95,def2,DUMMY,0,0,0,,{\i1\c&HFFFFFF&}Ginga wo hanare Iscandar e harubaru nozomu
Dialogue: 0,0:00:56.30,0:01:02.95,def2,DUMMY,0,0,0,,{\c&HFFFFFF&}{ginga wo hanare iscandar e harubaru nozomu}Leaving the Milky Way to go all the way to Iscandar
Dialogue: 0,0:01:02.95,0:01:10.23,def2,DUMMY,0,0,0,,{\i1\c&HFFFFFF&}Uchuu Senkan Yamato
Dialogue: 0,0:01:02.95,0:01:10.23,def2,DUMMY,0,0,0,,{\c&HFFFFFF&}{uchuu senkan yamato} Space Battleship Yamato
Dialogue: 0,0:01:34.84,0:01:37.06,def2,{MAN,0,0,0,,{\c&HFFFE9F&}Unknown large...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:37.68,0:01:39.94,def2,{MAN,0,0,0,,{\c&HFFFE9F&}{Genzai}Currently, the migration ships are...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:41.72,0:01:44.34,def2,{TALAN,0,0,0,,I have an emergency transmission\N from the home planet Garmillas.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:45.34,0:01:47.32,def2,{DESLER,0,0,0,,Increase ship speed.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:47.32,0:01:47.80,def2,{TALAN,0,0,0,,Aye.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:07.58,0:02:10.10,def2,{MAN,0,0,0,,No use ! It's too strong !
Dialogue: 0,0:02:10.10,0:02:11.04,def2,{MAN,0,0,0,,What is it ?!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:12.82,0:02:16.96,def2,{HISS,0,0,0,,Unknown energy ?\N It's not the Bolar Federation's...?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:16.96,0:02:21.10,def2,{MAN,0,0,0,,The energy from that object is causing \Na chain reaction through the crust.{destruction of the crust.}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:26.82,0:02:30.94,def2,{MAN,0,0,0,,Once it reaches the already-fragile inner core...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:33.04,0:02:35.32,def2,{HISS,0,0,0,,If it's not Bolar's, then who...?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:35.76,0:02:40.10,def2,{MAN,0,0,0,,More spear-like objects incoming ! \NToo many to count !
Dialogue: 0,0:03:26.94,0:03:30.02,def2,{HISS,0,0,0,,Why ?\N Who's doing this, and for what reason ?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:30.02,0:03:33.58,def2,{MAN,0,0,0,,President Hiss, please hurry !\NThis place won't last much longer !
Dialogue: 0,0:03:50.14,0:03:52.90,def2,{LIZA,0,0,0,,What's going on ?\NWhat will happen to us, Mom ?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:52.90,0:03:55.66,def2,{MOM,0,0,0,,Don't worry. We'll be alright.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:57.26,0:03:58.22,def2,{ODDO,0,0,0,,That's terrible.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:58.22,0:03:59.40,def2,{MAN,0,0,0,,Hey, look !
Dialogue: 0,0:04:04.38,0:04:05.70,def2,{ODDO,0,0,0,,That's Daddy's ship.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:06.22,0:04:09.04,def2,{ODDO,0,0,0,,Mom, Daddy's ship has arrived !
Dialogue: 0,0:04:10.84,0:04:12.02,def2,{MOM,0,0,0,,My dear...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:13.10,0:04:16.10,def2,{BERGER,0,0,0,,How disgusting of them to target\Npeople who are in the middle of moving !
Dialogue: 0,0:04:16.70,0:04:20.44,def2,{WOLF,0,0,0,,Let them feel our fangs as\Npunishment for hurting our planet.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:21.02,0:04:24.55,def2,{DESLER,0,0,0,,Don't let them get away with this !\NAll ships, charge !
Dialogue: 0,0:04:40.02,0:04:42.40,def2,{BERGER,0,0,0,,No matter how strong the body is...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:44.14,0:04:46.05,def2,{WOLF,0,0,0,,...if we destroy the base...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:58.04,0:05:00.17,def2,{GOL,0,0,0,,How was that ?\N You good for nothing !
Dialogue: 0,0:05:00.17,0:05:03.32,def2,{GOL,0,0,0,,We'll knock all of them down the same way !
Dialogue: 0,0:05:06.32,0:05:08.94,def2,{WOLF,0,0,0,,But there are too many...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:10.96,0:05:13.12,def2,{HISS,0,0,0,,The situation is dire.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:13.12,0:05:15.12,def2,{HISS,0,0,0,,No, I mean hopeless.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:18.14,0:05:21.62,def2,{HISS,0,0,0,,{\c&HFFFE9F&}We don't know what'll happen next.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:21.62,0:05:25.32,def2,{HISS,0,0,0,,{\c&HFFFE9F&}Today's Your Excellency's date of return. \NHow could this be happening ?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:26.74,0:05:29.64,def2,{DESLER,0,0,0,,Hurry and let the remaining\N migration ships depart.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:30.92,0:05:33.96,def2,{DESLER,0,0,0,,Hiss, you too should\N join them, before it's too late.{you should escape immediately.}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:35.44,0:05:38.54,def2,{HISS,0,0,0,,{\c&HFFFE9F&}I've heard that you changed.\NLooks like the rumors were true…{ Looks like it's true.}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:39.70,0:05:43.14,def2,{HISS,0,0,0,,{\c&HFFFE9F&}No, this new you must have\N been your true self all along.{Well, this must be your true self.}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:44.40,0:05:47.26,def2,{HISS,0,0,0,,{\c&HFFFE9F&}Bless the land that gave birth to us.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:47.88,0:05:50.84,def2,{HISS,0,0,0,,{\c&HFFFE9F&}Long live Desler. Long live Garmillan.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:02.20,0:06:03.70,def2,{DESLER,0,0,0,,Save as many...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:03.70,0:06:07.26,def2,{DESLER,0,0,0,,...save as many people of Garmillas as possible.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:17.70,0:06:20.56,def2,{MELDERS,0,0,0,,{\c&HFFFE9F&}Such a terrible noise, Daeder.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:20.56,0:06:22.50,def2,{DADAR,0,0,0,,It's a part of the charm.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:22.50,0:06:25.00,def2,{MELDERS,0,0,0,,{\c&HFFFE9F&}Don't underestimate it.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:25.00,0:06:30.36,def2,{MELDERS,0,0,0,,{\i0\c&HFFFE9F&}Too much noise will ruin the melody. \NIt's the sign of a needle jumping.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:34.08,0:06:37.88,def2,{DEDAR,0,0,0,,I'm aware of it, Your Excellency Mœlders.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:43.02,0:06:46.52,def2,{DEDAR,0,0,0,,The recovery operation will be carried out,\Nwithout delay, as dictated by the timeline.{The recovery operation will be carried\N out as scheduled, without delay.}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:47.28,0:06:49.86,def2,{DEDAR,0,0,0,,All the noise that's not on \Nthe record will be erased.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:03.02,0:07:05.60,def2,{DEDAR,0,0,0,,Great Pleiades, advance !
Dialogue: 0,0:07:33.04,0:07:34.20,def2,{HILDE,0,0,0,,{\pos(882,1048)}Uncle...{Father...}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:34.20,0:07:35.40,def2,{HILDE,0,0,0,,Uncle...{Father...}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:35.40,0:07:36.60,def2,{HILDE,0,0,0,,Uncle !{Father !}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:39.00,0:07:41.64,def2,{HISS,0,0,0,,Too bad we couldn't be a \Nreal father and daughter...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:49.04,0:07:50.88,def2,{MAN,0,0,0,,Double-check the rendezvous point.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:53.32,0:07:54.78,def2,{HILDE,0,0,0,,Father...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:57.86,0:08:00.80,def2,{HISS,0,0,0,,{\c&HFFFFFF&}Starsha, please have mercy...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:03.20,0:08:05.92,def2,{DITZ,0,0,0,,Looks like the destruction of the core has begun.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:06.46,0:08:09.98,def2,{DITZ,0,0,0,,We don't know how it will affect Iscandar.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:10.74,0:08:12.48,def2,{DITZ,0,0,0,,Please, go to the shelter.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:13.54,0:08:14.48,def2,{YURISIA,0,0,0,,Sister...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:15.40,0:08:17.20,def2,{STARSIA,0,0,0,,Garmillas isn't the target.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:18.32,0:08:21.92,def2,{STARSIA,0,0,0,,Whoever it is, their target is not Garmillas.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:26.18,0:08:27.42,def2,{STARSIA,0,0,0,,Abelt...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:49.10,0:08:50.70,def2,{MAN,0,0,0,,Hurry !\NWe're leaving !
Dialogue: 0,0:08:55.06,0:08:56.60,def2,{BERGER,0,0,0,,This is it, huh...?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:57.30,0:09:00.56,def2,{BERGER,0,0,0,,All ships, leave Planet Garmillas\N at maximum combat speed !
Dialogue: 0,0:09:04.88,0:09:07.20,def2,{MAN,0,0,0,,The Deusula III is descending !
Dialogue: 0,0:09:07.68,0:09:08.40,def2,{BERGER,0,0,0,,What ?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:12.54,0:09:13.72,def2,{WOLF,0,0,0,,Führer Desler...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:13.98,0:09:14.80,def2,{GOL,0,0,0,,That's ridiculous !
Dialogue: 0,0:09:18.60,0:09:20.80,def2,{TALAN,0,0,0,,Your Excellency, it's too dangerous.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:20.80,0:09:21.60,def2,{DESLER,0,0,0,,Still more...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:22.80,0:09:27.35,def2,{DESLER,0,0,0,,{Still more people...} There should still be\N many more lives we can save.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:29.84,0:09:32.90,def2,{DESLER,0,0,0,,Even one more... \NJust one more person...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:34.14,0:09:35.36,def2,{DESLER,0,0,0,,I promised.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:36.48,0:09:40.04,def2,{DESLER,0,0,0,,I promised to save the planet\N and the people of Garmillas.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:41.06,0:09:42.34,def2,{DESLER,0,0,0,,I did...!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:47.22,0:09:48.40,def2,{DESLER,0,0,0,,Talan !
Dialogue: 0,0:09:48.40,0:09:49.60,def2,{TALAN,0,0,0,,If that's so...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:49.60,0:09:53.78,def2,{TALAN,0,0,0,,If that's so, you must not die here in vain !
Dialogue: 0,0:11:04.74,0:11:07.24,def2,{DESLER,0,0,0,,Garmillas...Garmillas is...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:11.92,0:11:15.05,def2,{DESLER,0,0,0,,The planet's doom was preordained…
Dialogue: 0,0:11:15.05,0:11:19.64,def2,{DESLER,0,0,0,,For that reason,\N we kept spilling blood in war.{It was destined to die. \NThat's why we kept spilling blood in war.}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:21.36,0:11:24.06,def2,{DESLER,0,0,0,,Everything we fought for...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:25.38,0:11:26.72,def2,{DESLER,0,0,0,,Everything...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:26.94,0:11:29.08,def2,{MAN,0,0,0,,Multiple distress signals received !
Dialogue: 0,0:11:29.08,0:11:32.26,def2,{MAN,0,0,0,,The remaining immigration fleet \Nappears to be landing on Iscandar !
Dialogue: 0,0:11:33.22,0:11:36.04,def2,{TALAN,0,0,0,,Regroup the fleet. We will...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:36.04,0:11:37.34,def2,{MAN,0,0,0,,Iscandar !
Dialogue: 0,0:11:51.62,0:11:54.38,def2,{MAN,0,0,0,,Iscandar's left the Salzar System's orbit.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:55.12,0:11:57.60,def2,{MAN,0,0,0,,Velocity is 87 and increasing.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:58.88,0:12:01.70,def2,{TALAN,0,0,0,,Is it because it lost\N its twin planet, Garmillas…?{Is it because it lost its twin ?}{one of the twin planets ?}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:02.66,0:12:05.08,def2,{TALAN,0,0,0,,But this speed is...?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:07.08,0:12:08.06,def2,{DESLER,0,0,0,,Follow...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:08.94,0:12:10.28,def2,{DESLER,0,0,0,,Follow it !
Dialogue: 0,0:12:20.10,0:12:25.98,def2,{MAN,0,0,0,,{\c&HFFFE9F&}To all Garmillas people in the universe, \NPlanet Garmillas is gone.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:27.48,0:12:32.64,def2,{MAN,0,0,0,,{\c&HFFFE9F&}I repeat. Our home planet...Planet Garmillas is gone.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:40.86,0:12:42.30,def2,{YABU,0,0,0,,Excuse me...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:43.22,0:12:48.76,def2,{YABU,0,0,0,,Sorry to bother you, but can you take a look at my communications server for Garmillas ?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:48.76,0:12:50.36,def2,{YABU,0,0,0,,It's acting odd.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:53.50,0:12:54.62,def2,{YABU,0,0,0,,Um..
Dialogue: 0,0:12:54.62,0:12:56.16,def2,{MAN,0,0,0,,What's with him ?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:56.70,0:12:58.88,def2,{MAN,0,0,0,,That traitor is trying to be friendly, huh ?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:59.44,0:13:03.18,def2,{MAN,0,0,0,,It sure is odd for a Garmillas engineer\Nlike Yabu to speak Earth’s language.{It's strange for a Garmillas\N engineer to speak our language.}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:04.64,0:13:05.46,def2,{RYUSUKE,0,0,0,,Hi...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:08.64,0:13:11.52,def2,{RYUSUKE,0,0,0,,If you don't mind, I can take a look.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:19.56,0:13:25.88,def2,{YAMANAMI,0,0,0,,There's a subspace gate between the \NMagellanic Cloud and our Milky Way Galaxy.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:26.76,0:13:32.28,def2,{YAMANAMI,0,0,0,,It's part of the most important infrastructure that supports\N the large migration of the Garmillas people to Planet Galman.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:33.54,0:13:39.56,def2,{YAMANAMI,0,0,0,,A Garmillas patrol fleet is protecting all of\N the gates in preparation for a Bolar attack.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:40.30,0:13:43.96,def2,{YAMANAMI,0,0,0,,{waga}Our group will reach the gate in two days.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:45.18,0:13:50.82,def2,{YAMANAMI,0,0,0,,{keibi}After completing a ceremony with the Garmillas patrol fleet, and passing through the gate, we'll be in...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:51.38,0:13:53.80,def2,{YUKI,0,0,0,,The Magellanic Cloud...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:53.80,0:13:56.90,def2,{YUKI,0,0,0,,One more step, and we'll reach \NGarmillas and Iscandar, won't we ?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:57.46,0:14:03.78,def2,{YAMANAMI,0,0,0,,You're right. It's almost like barging\N into someone's yard, though...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:04.80,0:14:06.51,def2,{YAMANAMI,0,0,0,,That said, Captain Kodai...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:07.45,0:14:12.60,def2,{YAMANAMI,0,0,0,,Has our fleet matured enough \Nto stand on its own feet yet ?\N{Now, Captain Kodai, has our fleet grown\Nup enough to stand on its own feet ?}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:13.34,0:14:14.28,def2,{KODAI,0,0,0,,Not yet.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:14.92,0:14:18.42,def2,{KODAI,0,0,0,,They're talented in their own right,\N but still inexperienced.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:19.64,0:14:24.96,def2,{KODAI,0,0,0,,They're educated, but still don't understand the \Nsignificance of operating the ship and its weapons.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:27.10,0:14:33.04,def2,{KODAI,0,0,0,,{kibishii}We still have a lot to teach in order for them to\N survive this severe interplanetary circumstance.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:36.96,0:14:38.80,def2,{YAMANAMI,0,0,0,,The troublemaker, as well ?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:41.04,0:14:46.88,def2,{YAMANAMI,0,0,0,,Yamato has an uneasy atmosphere, including the situation around the engineer, Yabu.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:48.00,0:14:52.76,def2,{YAMANAMI,0,0,0,,Could you tell me what you\N really think, Captain Kodai ?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:53.74,0:14:58.16,def2,{YAMANAMI,0,0,0,,What is your true intention of keeping\N Domon Ryusuke aboard the Yamato ?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:08.62,0:15:10.24,def2,{KODAI,0,0,0,,He's like me.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:12.24,0:15:15.78,def2,{KODAI,0,0,0,,I couldn't acknowledge the death \Nof my brother a long time ago.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:15.78,0:15:19.78,def2,{KODAI,0,0,0,,He has the same look in his eyes that\N I did when I was testing Captain Okita.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:20.30,0:15:22.96,def2,{KODAI,0,0,0,,No, his is heavier.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:22.96,0:15:29.16,def2,{KODAI,0,0,0,,His burden is heavier because he lost \Nhis father in exchange for my life.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:30.68,0:15:34.48,def2,{KODAI,0,0,0,,I don't think I can prove myself\N enough for the sacrifice he made. {suffered.}{'s bearing.}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:34.48,0:15:38.26,def2,{KODAI,0,0,0,,{kancho}As a captain, it might be the right \Ndecision to leave him behind.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:39.60,0:15:41.58,def2,{KODAI,0,0,0,,Even so, I...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:52.80,0:15:57.72,def2,{YABU,0,0,0,,The episode about Kodai and Mori became a \Nconversation topic among the people of Garmillas.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:57.72,0:16:03.80,def2,{YABU,0,0,0,,The people of Earth are impressive for sacrificing the Time{Dimensional} Fault to save the lives of two people.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:04.60,0:16:07.76,def2,{RYUSUKE,0,0,0,,It was just the momentum of the time. \NIt's called populism.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:08.64,0:16:10.48,def2,{RYUSUKE,0,0,0,,It was a choice without conviction.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:11.28,0:16:13.90,def2,{RYUSUKE,0,0,0,,That's why people are scared\N of the possibility of another war.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:14.88,0:16:19.12,def2,{RYUSUKE,0,0,0,,{senkyo}There’s even an outrageous rumor that the\Nmilitary manipulated the voting results.{There's even an absurd rumor that the\N military is manipulating voting results.}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:23.64,0:16:30.76,def2,{YABU,0,0,0,,Sorry. It's funny that a traitor and a troublemaker\Nare discussing politics on the Yamato's observation deck.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:33.48,0:16:37.70,def2,{RYUSUKE,0,0,0,,Forgive me for not being able to help\N you solve your communication problem.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:38.50,0:16:43.26,def2,{YABU,0,0,0,,It's alright.\N I'm glad I can talk to someone like this.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:47.62,0:16:53.00,def2,{RYUSUKE,0,0,0,,If my father knew that I was on the Yamato,\N he'd be so happy that he'd be jumping around.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:55.56,0:17:00.98,def2,{RYUSUKE,0,0,0,,Once the Time{Dimensional} Fault was{is} gone, \Na small sub-contractor like ours couldn't{wouldn't} survive.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:01.94,0:17:07.24,def2,{RYUSUKE,0,0,0,,As the company owner, my father wouldn't\N vote for the rescue of Captain Kodai.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:09.14,0:17:11.60,def2,{RYUSUKE,0,0,0,,But what he really wanted would be...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:18.94,0:17:20.95,def2,{RYUSUKE,0,0,0,,{jiko}Accident, or suicide…
Dialogue: 0,0:17:20.95,0:17:22.78,def2,{RYUSUKE,0,0,0,,{jiko}…even now, we're still not sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:23.54,0:17:29.48,def2,{RYUSUKE,0,0,0,,{tashika}What's for sure is, he was\N exhausted from managing finances.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:31.24,0:17:37.18,def2,{RYUSUKE,0,0,0,,{demo}When I found him, he was still alive. \NHe looked up at the sky and smiled.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:43.48,0:17:48.22,def2,{RYUSUKE,0,0,0,,It was the very moment when the Yamato\N returned from the higher dimension.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:49.84,0:17:51.62,def2,{RYUSUKE,0,0,0,,{chikyu}“A hero who saved Earth”…
Dialogue: 0,0:17:52.97,0:17:58.24,def2,{RYUSUKE,0,0,0,,Be that as it may, bearing my father's death in mind,\Nthe emerging hero appeared to me as a demon.{A hero who saved Earth might have seemed like a demon who destroyed his life.}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:59.60,0:18:01.22,def2,{RYUSUKE,0,0,0,,Why did he smile ?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:02.06,0:18:03.46,def2,{YABU,0,0,0,,You'll figure it out.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:04.88,0:18:12.24,def2,{YABU,0,0,0,,Oh, sorry. I feel like I can understand\N him because of who I am now.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:13.12,0:18:16.38,def2,{YABU,0,0,0,,After all, you were with\N your father when he…{You were with him when...}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:21.02,0:18:23.34,def2,{SAKAMOTO,0,0,0,,Hey Domon, this is big !
Dialogue: 0,0:18:23.34,0:18:25.74,def2,{SAKAMOTO,0,0,0,,Planet Garmillas ! Planet Garmillas was...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:29.02,0:18:30.14,def2,{SHIMA,0,0,0,,...destroyed.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:34.72,0:18:38.82,def2,{SHIMA,0,0,0,,The planet was under attack by\N an unknown enemy shortly before...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:38.82,0:18:41.36,def2,{SHIMA,0,0,0,,...but it's unclear whether the attack \Nwas related to the planet's destruction.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:42.46,0:18:46.46,def2,{KAORU,0,0,0,,We don't know if the enemy was \Nthe Bolar Federation or not.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:47.02,0:18:49.60,def2,{SHIMA,0,0,0,,The migration project had just begun, so...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:51.15,0:18:55.00,def2,{SHIMA,0,0,0,,...the majority of the Garmillas people would \Nhave been caught in the planet's destruction...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:55.00,0:18:56.02,def2,{SHIMA,0,0,0,,...most likely.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:57.46,0:19:01.88,def2,{KAORU,0,0,0,,Most of the migration ships \Nappear to have been destroyed.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:02.58,0:19:06.92,def2,{KAORU,0,0,0,,{tada}A group of survivors has\N landed on Iscandar, but...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:07.84,0:19:13.60,def2,{SHIMA,0,0,0,,Iscandar itself is in big trouble because\N it has left its orbit, moving out of control.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:16.66,0:19:19.68,def2,{SHIMA,0,0,0,,The Desler Fleet is in pursuit.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:20.68,0:19:24.36,def2,{SHIMA,0,0,0,,An estimated 100,000 refugees \Nhave landed on Iscandar.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:25.74,0:19:29.80,def2,{SHIMA,0,0,0,,We have no idea what kind \Nof natural disasters are happening.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:29.80,0:19:32.72,def2,{SHIMA,0,0,0,,I doubt the Desler Fleet alone can save them.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:36.72,0:19:39.26,def2,{MAN,0,0,0,,How could this be...?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:41.28,0:19:47.64,def2,{MAN,0,0,0,,Right around there,\N that was {\i1}our{\i0} home planet.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:49.94,0:19:57.22,def2,{MAN,0,0,0,,Even though it was dying, how could\N it go before me ? Don't you think so ?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:01.24,0:20:05.70,def2,{DITZ,0,0,0,,We don't know why, \Nbut Iscandar is still accelerating.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:06.32,0:20:08.66,def2,{DITZ,0,0,0,,At this rate, I can't imagine\N how the surface will deteriorate.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:09.80,0:20:13.96,def2,{DITZ,0,0,0,,{I want you to open}I implore you to open the entrance\Nto Sanktel, beneath the royal capital.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:15.02,0:20:17.96,def2,{DITZ,0,0,0,,That's the only way to save\N 100,000 Garmillas refugees...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:17.96,0:20:18.90,def2,{YURISIA,0,0,0,,No.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:20.90,0:20:26.86,def2,{YURISIA,0,0,0,,I can't allow you to do that.\N It's a sanctuary reserved for royalty.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:26.86,0:20:29.86,def2,{YURISIA,0,0,0,,We cannot accept strangers who \Nhave not undergone the ritual.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:31.50,0:20:32.80,def2,{DITZ,0,0,0,,Ritual...?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:36.94,0:20:38.68,def2,{MAN,0,0,0,,Iscandar is continuing to accelerate.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:39.14,0:20:41.70,def2,{BERGER,0,0,0,,Increase our speed ! \NDon't fall behind !
Dialogue: 0,0:20:43.00,0:20:45.94,def2,{BERGER,0,0,0,,We're barely keeping up \Nat maximum combat speed !
Dialogue: 0,0:20:47.14,0:20:49.96,def2,{BERGER,0,0,0,,It didn't just leave orbit.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:49.96,0:20:51.70,def2,{BERGER,0,0,0,,There must be something ahead.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:53.08,0:20:54.22,def2,{BERGER,0,0,0,, What is it ?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:54.84,0:20:56.52,def2,{MAN,0,0,0,,Multiple Geshtam signatures detected !
Dialogue: 0,0:21:10.14,0:21:12.18,def2,{DADAR,0,0,0,,Eliminate the noise.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:14.20,0:21:15.20,def2,{BERGER,0,0,0,,Who are they ?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:18.62,0:21:22.04,def2,{BERGER,0,0,0,,I see. \NThey're the owners of those spears.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:22.04,0:21:22.98,def2,{BERGER,0,0,0,,If so...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:35.50,0:21:39.38,def2,{BERGER,0,0,0,,Don't be afraid !\N Unlike the spears, we can shoot them down !
Dialogue: 0,0:21:39.38,0:21:40.96,def2,{MAN,0,0,0,,{\c&HFFFE9F&}Fan out, Berger !
Dialogue: 0,0:21:58.86,0:22:01.56,def2,{DESLER,0,0,0,,They're the enemy who \Ndestroyed Planet Garmillas.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:02.84,0:22:05.18,def2,{DESLER,0,0,0,,Don't let even one ship escape !
Dialogue: 0,0:22:05.18,0:22:06.54,def2,{DESLER,0,0,0,,Annihilate them !
Dialogue: 0,0:22:07.72,0:22:10.42,def2,{MAN,0,0,0,,Situation prediction, 0.06.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:10.42,0:22:13.30,def2,{MAN,0,0,0,,Begin corrective action and share with all ships.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:13.30,0:22:15.38,def2,{MELDERS,0,0,0,,{\c&HFFFE9F&}The needle jumped, didn't it, Daeder ?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:15.88,0:22:18.38,def2,{DADAR,0,0,0,,It's within the margin of fluctuation.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:19.86,0:22:23.64,def2,{MELDERS,0,0,0,,{\c&HFFFE9F&}Then, let's get back to the original timeline.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:32.28,0:22:34.56,def2,{TALAN,0,0,0,,It can't be.\N A planet was forced to...
Dialogue: 0,0:22:35.68,0:22:37.52,def2,{TALAN,0,0,0,,...Geshtam jump ?!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:39.60,0:22:44.70,Karaoke Translation op,{RYUSUKE,0,0,0,,{\fscx113\fscy112\3c&H000008&\pos(360,1046)}The Last Day of Garmillas
Dialogue: 0,0:22:39.60,0:22:44.70,Karaoke Translation op,{RYUSUKE,0,0,0,,{\fscx113\fscy112\pos(210,874)\3c&H000008&}Episode 3
Dialogue: 0,0:22:46.24,0:22:51.58,def2,{RYUSUKE,0,0,0,,{\fscx113\fscy112\c&HFFFFFF&\pos(972,680)}Save Iscandar! Rebellion of the Young Heroes!!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:46.24,0:22:51.58,Karaoke Translation op,{RYUSUKE,0,0,0,,{\fscx113\fscy112\pos(968,466)\3c&H000008&}Next Time
